Package: brvmr
Type: Package
Title: Free Access to BRVM Stock Market Data
Version: 0.1.0
Language: fr
Authors@R: person("Zabaly", "Noumoutchè", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "harzat1999@hotmail.com", comment = "alias Harzat")
Description: Light client to read prices, indices and dividends of the
    Bourse Regionale des Valeurs Mobilieres (BRVM, West African stock
    exchange) from the public mirror 'harzat/brvm-data-public' of BRVMetrics.
    The package ships no data: it is downloaded at call time. Data remain the
    property of their sources (BRVM, SikaFinance, RicheBourse), with no
    guarantee of accuracy. This is not investment advice.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: jsonlite, utils
Suggests: testthat (>= 3.0.0), curl
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/harzat/brvmr, https://brvmetrics.vercel.app
BugReports: https://github.com/harzat/brvmr/issues
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.1.0
